<p>In Italy, roughly 70% of households have <a href="https://amzn.to/3hfoLd9">a Bialetti Moka Pot</a>. And chances are you have one too. But are you using it the right way? Probably not, says James Hoffmann, the author of <em><a href="https://amzn.to/339vhLl">The World Atlas of Coffee</a>.&nbsp;</em>Above, he sets the record straight, demonstrating the best technique for making a great cup of coffee. Enjoy this public service announcement and use it well.</p>
